      "commit": "dd318fd",
      "kind": "onboarding",
      "summary": "keybinding_helpers.lua assigned to a for-loop variable, which Lua 5.5 rejects at compile time. keybinding_preferences failed, no keybindings-state.json was written and cybexos-desktop-check rejected the configuration",
